(7089125, 1079245, 162801, '<td valign="top">this is absolutely perfect and fits the description of the challenge to a T.<br/> <br/>this is photography to me...it''s nice to see that, at least to me, seems like it didn''t spend much time in post like so many of the photographs in this challenge as well as on the site in general.<br/> <br/>the subject is beautiful, interesting and simple, the backdrop is visually pleasing, it has clarity without being too sharp, the colors, the composition and the <b>WARMTH</b>...you just nailed it.  <br/> <br/>it has journalistic value, tells a story or at the least draws one, and draws me in..can''t stop looking at this one...<br/> <br/>this is what i strive for in my portraits and photography...i hope i can get to this level one day...thank you.<br/> <br/>simplicity is bliss...<br/> <br/>love it.<br/> <br/>thank you.</td>', 'this is absolutely perfect and fits the description of the challenge to a T. this is photography to me...it''s nice to see that, at least to me, seems like it didn''t spend much time in post like so many of the photographs in this challenge as well as on the site in general. the subject is beautiful, interesting and simple, the backdrop is visually pleasing, it has clarity without being too sharp, the colors, the composition and the WARMTH...you just nailed it.   it has journalistic value, tells a story or at the least draws one, and draws me in..can''t stop looking at this one... this is what i strive for in my portraits and photography...i hope i can get to this level one day...thank you. simplicity is bliss... love it. thank you.', '2013-08-18 17:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
